  SUBMITTED --> PARTIALLY_FAILED: some lines failed
  SUBMITTED --> FAILED: billing account or all lines failed
  PARTIALLY_FAILED --> COMPLETED: back office retry succeeds
  FAILED --> COMPLETED: back office retry succeeds
  COMPLETED --> [*]

